sequenceDiagram
    title JEE Connect — Test Taking, Scoring & Parent SMS Alert Flow

    actor Student
    participant UI as 📱 JEE Connect App
    participant ATE as 🎯 AdaptiveTestEngine
    participant DB as 💾 Local SQLite
    participant GS as 🔥 GamificationService
    participant Sync as 🔄 SyncService
    participant Firebase as ☁️ Firebase Cloud
    participant Bridge as 🌐 DB Bridge Server
    participant Twilio as 📲 Twilio SMS Gateway
    actor Parent

    Note over Student, Parent: === Phase 1: Adaptive Test Generation ===

    Student->>UI: Opens "Smart Practice"
    UI->>ATE: generateAdaptiveTest(userEmail)
    ATE->>DB: SELECT chapter accuracies<br/>FROM test_attempts
    DB-->>ATE: weakness heatmap data
    ATE->>ATE: Sort chapters by accuracy (weakest first)
    ATE->>DB: SELECT questions WHERE chapter_id<br/>IN weakest chapters
    DB-->>ATE: filtered PYQ questions
    ATE->>DB: INSERT INTO tests (adaptive test)
    ATE-->>UI: testId, questions[]

    Note over Student, Parent: === Phase 2: Exam with Proctoring ===

    Student->>UI: Starts Test
    UI->>UI: Enter Fullscreen Mode
    UI->>UI: Start Timer (countdown)

    loop For Each Question
        Student->>UI: Selects answer / enters numerical
        UI->>UI: Record answer + time_per_question
    end

    alt Tab Switch Detected
        UI->>UI: tab_violations++
        UI->>UI: Show Warning Overlay
        alt violations >= 3
            UI->>DB: UPDATE test_attempts SET<br/>is_disqualified = 1
            UI-->>Student: ❌ Disqualified!
        end
    end

    Student->>UI: Submits Test / Timer Expires

    Note over Student, Parent: === Phase 3: Scoring & XP ===

    UI->>DB: Get correct_answers for all questions
    DB-->>UI: correct answers + marks + negative_marks
    UI->>UI: Calculate score, correct_count, wrong_count
    UI->>DB: UPDATE test_attempts SET<br/>score, status='completed'

    UI->>GS: awardXP(test_complete + per-question XP)
    GS->>DB: INSERT INTO user_xp_log
    GS->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE daily_streaks (today)
    GS->>GS: checkAndUnlockAchievements()

    alt Perfect Score
        GS->>DB: Unlock "Perfect Score" badge 🏅
        GS-->>UI: Achievement unlocked!
    end

    UI-->>Student: 📊 Results: Score, Accuracy, XP earned

    Note over Student, Parent: === Phase 4: Offline Sync Queue ===

    UI->>DB: INSERT INTO sync_queue<br/>(test_attempt payload)
    Sync->>Sync: Check connectivity

    alt Online
        Sync->>Firebase: Delta sync — push pending records
        Firebase-->>Sync: Sync confirmed ✅
        Sync->>DB: UPDATE sync_queue SET synced = 1
    else Offline
        Sync->>DB: Queue remains pending
        Note over Sync: Will retry on next<br/>connectivity change
    end

    Note over Student, Parent: === Phase 5: Weekly Parent SMS Alert ===

    Bridge->>Bridge: Sunday 10 PM Scheduler Trigger
    Bridge->>Firebase: Fetch all users + test_attempts
    Firebase-->>Bridge: User data + attempt history

    Bridge->>Bridge: Calculate weekly stats:<br/>tests_taken, accuracy, study_hours

    alt Accuracy < 50% (Critical)
        Bridge->>Twilio: Send SMS to parent phone
        Note over Twilio: "Your child completed 3 tests<br/>with 42% accuracy this week.<br/>2.5 hours studied."
        Twilio-->>Parent: 📱 SMS Alert Delivered
    else Accuracy >= 50%
        Bridge->>Bridge: No alert needed (student performing well)
    end
